    <div class=3D"nav">ONE MORE TIME</div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class=3D"hero">
      <div>
        <div class=3D"eyebrow">REMINISCE UF =C2=B7 ONE MORE TIME</div>
        <h1>Upplev dina minnen. One more time.</h1>
        <p>Samla dina favoritbilder och videoklipp p=C3=A5 ett st=C3=A4lle.=
 Ber=C3=A4tta vad som =C3=A4r viktigt f=C3=B6r dig, s=C3=A5 skapar vi en pe=
rsonlig video utifr=C3=A5n dina =C3=B6nskem=C3=A5l.</p>
        <a class=3D"btn btn-primary" href=3D"file:///media/archive/bestalln=
ingshemsida_startpaket%20(1).zip/bestallningshemsida/index.html#bestall">Be=
st=C3=A4ll din video <span aria-hidden=3D"true">=E2=86=97</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"hero-visual" aria-label=3D"Exempel p=C3=A5 en personlig=
 minnesvideo">
        <div class=3D"visual-frame">ONE MORE<br>TIME</div>
        <div class=3D"play" aria-hidden=3D"true">=E2=96=B6</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class=3D"section">
      <div class=3D"section-inner">
        <div class=3D"eyebrow">Enkelt fr=C3=A5n b=C3=B6rjan till slut</div>
        <h2>S=C3=A5 g=C3=A5r det till</h2>
        <p class=3D"sub">Fyra enkla steg fr=C3=A5n dina filer till en f=C3=
=A4rdig video.</p>
        <div class=3D"steps">
          <article class=3D"step"><div class=3D"step-num">STEG 01</div><h3>=
V=C3=A4lj dina filer</h3><p>L=C3=A4gg till b=C3=A5de bilder och videoklipp =
fr=C3=A5n din mobil eller dina filer.</p></article>
          <article class=3D"step"><div class=3D"step-num">STEG 02</div><h3>=
Ber=C3=A4tta vad du vill ha</h3><p>Skriv om l=C3=A5t, k=C3=A4nsla eller s=
=C3=A4rskilda minnen du vill lyfta fram.</p></article>
          <article class=3D"step"><div class=3D"step-num">STEG 03</div><h3>=
Skicka best=C3=A4llningen</h3><p>Fyll i kontaktuppgifterna och v=C3=A4lj di=
na samtycken.</p></article>
          <article class=3D"step"><div class=3D"step-num">STEG 04</div><h3>=
Vi kontaktar dig</h3><p>Vi h=C3=B6r av oss om betalning och detaljer innan =
vi b=C3=B6rjar skapa videon.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class=3D"section order-section" id=3D"bestall">
      <div class=3D"order-card">
        <div class=3D"form-head">
          <div><div class=3D"eyebrow">Din best=C3=A4llning</div><h2>Skapa d=
in video</h2><p class=3D"sub">Filer markerade nedan l=C3=A4ggs till i samma=
 best=C3=A4llning, =C3=A4ven om du v=C3=A4ljer dem vid olika tillf=C3=A4lle=
n.</p></div>
          <span class=3D"pill">Bilder + video</span>
        </div>
        <form id=3D"orderForm" action=3D"https://formsubmit.co/reminisce.sw=
eden@gmail.com" method=3D"POST" enctype=3D"multipart/form-data">
         =20
         =20
         =20
         =20
         =20
          <div class=3D"field">
            <label>1. Varifr=C3=A5n vill du l=C3=A4gga till filer?</label>
            <p class=3D"hint">Du kan anv=C3=A4nda flera alternativ. K=C3=A4=
llorna nedan =C3=B6ppnar de filv=C3=A4ljare som webbl=C3=A4saren/enheten st=
=C3=B6der.</p>
            <div class=3D"source-grid">
              <label class=3D"source"><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"sour=
ce" value=3D"Foton / Galleri" checked=3D""><span><strong>Foton / Galleri</s=
trong><small>Mobilens bilder och videor</small></span></label>
              <label class=3D"source"><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"sour=
ce" value=3D"Filer"><span><strong>Filer</strong><small>Enhetens filhanterar=
e</small></span></label>
              <label class=3D"source"><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"sour=
ce" value=3D"Google Drive"><span><strong>Google Drive</strong><small>Kr=C3=
=A4ver separat koppling</small></span></label>
              <label class=3D"source"><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"sour=
ce" value=3D"Snapchat"><span><strong>Snapchat</strong><small>Spara till mob=
ilen f=C3=B6rst</small></span></label>
              <label class=3D"source"><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"sour=
ce" value=3D"Instagram"><span><strong>Instagram</strong><small>Spara till m=
obilen f=C3=B6rst</small></span></label>
              <label class=3D"source"><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"sour=
ce" value=3D"Album"><span><strong>Album</strong><small>Via galleri eller fi=
lv=C3=A4ljare</small></span></label>
            </div>
            <input id=3D"fileInput" class=3D"file-input" type=3D"file" name=
=3D"attachment" accept=3D"image/*,video/*" multiple=3D"">
            <div class=3D"upload-box">
              <div class=3D"upload-icon" aria-hidden=3D"true">=EF=BC=8B</di=
v>
              <strong>L=C3=A4gg till bilder / videor</strong>
              <p class=3D"hint">V=C3=A4lj flera filer p=C3=A5 en g=C3=A5ng,=
 eller l=C3=A4gg till fler efter=C3=A5t. Spara f=C3=B6rst bilder och videor=
 fr=C3=A5n Snapchat eller Instagram till mobilen, och v=C3=A4lj dem sedan h=
=C3=A4r.</p>
              <div style=3D"display:flex;gap:10px;justify-content:center;fl=
ex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px">
                <button type=3D"button" class=3D"btn btn-secondary" id=3D"c=
hooseFiles">V=C3=A4lj filer fr=C3=A5n enheten</button>
                <button type=3D"button" class=3D"btn btn-primary" id=3D"ope=
nCamera">=F0=9F=8E=A5 Filma direkt med kameran</button>
              </div>
              <div class=3D"hint">Du kan ladda upp befintliga filer eller s=
pela in ett nytt klipp direkt h=C3=A4r.</div>
            </div>
            <div id=3D"fileList" class=3D"file-list" aria-live=3D"polite"><=
/div>
            <div id=3D"fileSummary" class=3D"hint">Inga filer valda =C3=A4n=
nu.</div>
          </div>

          <div class=3D"field">
            <label for=3D"email">2. E-postadress <span aria-hidden=3D"true"=
>*</span></label>
            <input id=3D"email" name=3D"email" type=3D"email" autocomplete=
=3D"email" placeholder=3D"namn@exempel.se" required=3D"">
          </div>
          <div class=3D"field">
            <label for=3D"phone">Telefonnummer <span aria-hidden=3D"true">*=
</span></label>
            <input id=3D"phone" name=3D"phone" type=3D"tel" autocomplete=3D=
"tel" placeholder=3D"07X XXX XX XX" required=3D"">
          </div>
          <div class=3D"field">
            <label for=3D"notes">N=C3=A5got vi ska t=C3=A4nka p=C3=A5? (val=
fritt)</label>
            <textarea id=3D"notes" name=3D"notes" placeholder=3D"Till exemp=
el en s=C3=A4rskild l=C3=A5t, vilka klipp vi ska framh=C3=A4va eller vilken=
 k=C3=A4nsla videon ska ha."></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"field">
            <fieldset style=3D"border:0;padding:0;margin:0">
              <legend>3. F=C3=A5r vi publicera videon p=C3=A5 v=C3=A5ra soc=
iala medier?</legend>
              <div class=3D"radio-row">
                <label><input type=3D"radio" name=3D"publish" value=3D"Ja">=
 Ja, ni f=C3=A5r publicera den</label>
                <label><input type=3D"radio" name=3D"publish" value=3D"Nej"=
 checked=3D""> Nej, tack</label>
              </div>
              <p class=3D"hint">Det h=C3=A4r valet =C3=A4r frivilligt och p=
=C3=A5verkar inte din best=C3=A4llning.</p>
            </fieldset>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"field checks">
            <label class=3D"check-row"><input type=3D"checkbox" name=3D"con=
tactConsent" required=3D""><span>Jag godk=C3=A4nner att ni kontaktar mig vi=
a e-post eller telefon ang=C3=A5ende min best=C3=A4llning och betalning. <s=
trong>*</strong></span></label>
          </div>
          <div class=3D"progress-note">Betalning sker inte direkt p=C3=A5 h=
emsidan. N=C3=A4r vi har tagit emot best=C3=A4llningen kontaktar vi dig f=
=C3=B6r att komma =C3=B6verens om betalningen.</div>
          <div class=3D"submit-row"><button type=3D"submit" class=3D"btn bt=
n-primary">Skicka best=C3=A4llning <span aria-hidden=3D"true">=E2=86=92</sp=
an></button><span class=3D"hint">F=C3=A4lt med * m=C3=A5ste fyllas i.</span=
></div>
          <p class=3D"notice">Integritet: skicka bara filer du har r=C3=A4t=
t att dela. Innan hemsidan publiceras beh=C3=B6ver en s=C3=A4ker uppladdnin=
g, lagring och radering av kundfiler kopplas in.</p>
          <div id=3D"success" class=3D"success" role=3D"status"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

